<ul>
<li>&lt;a href="Asu%20afghan%20hound"&gt;Asu afghan hound&lt;/a&gt; saka &lt;a href="Afghanistan"&gt;Afghanistan&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Asu%20akita%20inu"&gt;Asu akita inu&lt;/a&gt; saka Jepang.</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Asu%20basenji"&gt;Asu basenji&lt;/a&gt; saka &lt;a href="R%C3%A9publik%20Dh%C3%A9mokratik%20Kongo"&gt;Républik Dhémokratik Kongo&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Asu%20Chow%20Chow"&gt;Asu chow chow&lt;/a&gt; saka Républik Rakyat Cina.</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Asu%20Samoyed"&gt;Asu samoyed&lt;/a&gt; saka Fédérasi Ruslan lan Sibèri Kulon.</li>
